{"questionUid":"qid_v1_26a62a5c2fc811fe37310857f79339211a308a9983b16cec54deb0b0f8f0fb62","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/25_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":17,"sourceFingerprint":"655a0ca750e72f6199ba2190f03d6dc3f1ec80587690e8e0833bd93bfa4625f1","inputBundleSha":"2a27360a069d7c50d6ec1a059316937f5bd2e047e2552cbc914b5d010d0830e1","contentHash":"d21ac6c278c561766def8c36696b57ff45d43de37fce418fe3805aff05cb490b","solutionHash":"2802762a21e5af21f85aaf7ab7f28166ff0d5f0140f6fb6c97634ed15fd9a908","content":"다음 그림은 $\\angle AOB$와 크기가 같고 반직선 $O'X$를 한 변으로 하는 $\\angle EO'F$를 작도하는 과정을 나타낸 것이다. 보기에서 옳은 것만 있는 대로 고른 것은? [4점]","choices":["ㄱ, ㄴ","ㄱ, ㄷ","ㄴ, ㄹ","ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ, ㄹ"],"answer":"①","solution":"직선각과 맞꼭지각, 평행선의 동위각·엇각 및 삼각형의 내각의 합을 이용해 그림의 각을 차례로 계산한다. 그림의 대응 위치와 조건을 함께 확인하면 주어진 정답과 일치하는 결과는 ①이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/25_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q17.png","exists":true,"sha256":"0688bdeac0cbc6f808995b60bc382457113acee3e5d9d32136baa693805d2af5"}],"semanticContext":{"standardUnitKey":"M1-05","subUnitKey":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","primaryMethod":"copy an angle with compass arcs/chord","decisiveStep":"Draw equal-radius arcs at O,O′; mark C,D on the source and F on O′X; transfer chord CD to locate E. Equal-radius arcs with equal chords subtend equal central angles, so ㄱ,ㄴ are true (①).","problemTypeKey":"PT_M1_ANGLE_COPY_CONSTRUCTION","templateKey":"TPL_M1_ARC_AND_CHORD_TRANSFER_SEQUENCE","crossConceptKeys":[],"conditionKeys":[],"integrationPattern":"SEQUENTIAL","reviewStatus":"PROPOSED","sourceIssue":"Frozen solution discusses angle chasing rather than the shown compass construction."},"inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceFingerprint","inputBundleSha","contentHash","solutionHash","content","choices","answer","solution","images","semanticContext"],"blindInputSha":"99a941c4d412d2c9edb66490d3c969fd915638620d4c8c9dd48f52327beb6228"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_fdc2c11452f888f0c7e935b40eee4f284b64de7f0344a354b368d8fd841da5f6","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/25_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":18,"sourceFingerprint":"e357c56b146d2463b6e983381eda01e6f7f483734a83dd74959ba95e998b04f5","inputBundleSha":"1899232f75b444e7c7d829226597f883637ef0dcf5ce521e27cdac7545a18694","contentHash":"9537aa0e9f9d491bd3a0447be6712c47fb5a1cbc793e2770ffa2cd4e6c63308a","solutionHash":"add8bbba5954a60ec36b54c3915ef06498b99655418c5417fe201d8bc45bcb37","content":"길이가 $2\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $3\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $4\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $5\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $6\\,\\mathrm{cm}$인 다섯 개의 막대가 각각 $1$개씩 있다. 세 개의 막대를 골라서 삼각형을 만들 때, 삼각형은 몇 가지 만들 수 있는가? (단, 합동인 삼각형은 한 가지로 생각한다.) [4점]","choices":["$6$가지","$7$가지","$8$가지","$9$가지","$10$가지"],"answer":"②","solution":"주어진 변의 길이와 각의 관계를 대응시켜 SSS, SAS, ASA(AAS) 중 해당 조건을 적용한다. 주어진 정답과 일치하는 결과는 ②이다.","images":[],"semanticContext":{"standardUnitKey":"M1-05","subUnitKey":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","primaryMethod":"enumerate triples by triangle inequality","decisiveStep":"Valid triples from 2,3,4,5,6 are (2,3,4),(2,4,5),(2,5,6),(3,4,5),(3,4,6),(3,5,6),(4,5,6); all satisfy strict inequality, giving 7.","problemTypeKey":"PT_TRIANGLE_SIDE_FEASIBILITY_COUNT","templateKey":"TPL_COUNT_VALID_TRIPLES_FROM_FIXED_LENGTHS","crossConceptKeys":[],"conditionKeys":[],"integrationPattern":"CASE_BRANCH","reviewStatus":"PROPOSED","sourceIssue":"Frozen solution refers to congruence criteria rather than counting triples."},"inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceFingerprint","inputBundleSha","contentHash","solutionHash","content","choices","answer","solution","images","semanticContext"],"blindInputSha":"aea0bc50352de4ae9e3f97ec4dc903f875be7b84b1db60ff237583b25e1f8f9c"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_63f6f87ada000980090636747d14c464d02f8b8833e329b72f3df7b18eec46f4","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/25_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":19,"sourceFingerprint":"ee4c8671a80efb6b615f3367c024112069fdf82614db07d367aa2a8fe2bd43d3","inputBundleSha":"b6d344a71584456ec380567caf6e4b8ca12635aa95debc59e9c6e33a105443b2","contentHash":"4d47415d4604184948412ff80b6d0026e54f4176f16d7920f81d36486c45e37b","solutionHash":"8f542ac7dceb40bf6ed9fc62fcdb86d9038d50acd4e202ebea1c37ced29636d6","content":"다음 보기에서 $\\triangle ABC$가 한 가지로 작도되는 것만 있는 대로 고른 것은? [3점]<div class=\"note-box\">&lt;보기&gt;<br>ㄱ. $AB=4\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\angle A=40^\\circ$, $\\angle B=76^\\circ$인 경우<br>ㄴ. $AC=8\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $BC=12\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\angle C=112^\\circ$인 경우<br>ㄷ. $AB=6\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $BC=5\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\angle A=45^\\circ$인 경우<br>ㄹ. $\\angle A=36^\\circ$, $\\angle B=66^\\circ$, $\\angle C=78^\\circ$인 경우</div>","choices":["ㄱ, ㄴ","ㄴ, ㄷ","ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","ㄱ, ㄷ, ㄹ","ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ, ㄹ"],"answer":"①","solution":"직선각과 맞꼭지각, 평행선의 동위각·엇각 및 삼각형의 내각의 합을 이용해 그림의 각을 차례로 계산한다. 주어진 정답과 일치하는 결과는 ①이다.","images":[],"semanticContext":{"standardUnitKey":"M1-05","subUnitKey":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","primaryMethod":"triangle construction uniqueness","decisiveStep":"ㄱ fixes AB=4 and adjacent angles (ASA); ㄴ fixes AC=8,BC=12 and included angle C=112° (SAS). ㄷ is SSA with sin C=6sin45°/5≈0.849, allowing two C angles; ㄹ has no side length. Only ㄱ,ㄴ (①) fix one triangle.","problemTypeKey":"PT_UNIQUE_TRIANGLE_DETERMINATION_FROM_GIVEN_DATA","templateKey":"TPL_CLASSIFY_TRIANGLE_DATA_BY_UNIQUENESS","crossConceptKeys":[],"conditionKeys":[],"integrationPattern":"CASE_BRANCH","reviewStatus":"PROPOSED","sourceIssue":"Frozen solution gives generic angle calculations rather than uniqueness analysis."},"inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceFingerprint","inputBundleSha","contentHash","solutionHash","content","choices","answer","solution","images","semanticContext"],"blindInputSha":"688e24b9f3eae989bc58e6743d1f1d053af77bcd49f350333acf4a01de2928f1"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_aa67f2a9ec608f26ddcb2a911e675f1db7ebef15bd969c2b9dde373fde0bbeb3","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/25_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":20,"sourceFingerprint":"bbf2d74776f9e0d877ef328bcbdfafe90e6539866a102d65d58b84a40e1a1edd","inputBundleSha":"c7e8db4cb464dd216fb6077ceddcdf842b6f35beac8c5fc8eab51882180fed12","contentHash":"53fce8ed7811b1aa144d9a6b5e3bbb30b83905260abd482ffba6b7b926623ac5","solutionHash":"5bf778521ae8c30a41fd9981bed51988d7692f53441ecb298d8683c1b2f79ecb","content":"오른쪽 그림의 $\\triangle ABC$에서 $BC$의 중점을 $M$, 점 $B$에서 $AM$의 연장선에 내린 수선의 발을 $D$, 점 $C$에서 $AM$에 내린 수선의 발을 $E$라 하자. $BD=10\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $DM=4\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $AD=18\\,\\mathrm{cm}$일 때, $\\triangle ACE$의 넓이를 구하면? [5점]","choices":["$18\\,\\mathrm{cm}^2$","$\\dfrac{49}{2}\\,\\mathrm{cm}^2$","$32\\,\\mathrm{cm}^2$","$\\dfrac{81}{2}\\,\\mathrm{cm}^2$","$50\\,\\mathrm{cm}^2$"],"answer":"⑤","solution":"직선각과 맞꼭지각, 평행선의 동위각·엇각 및 삼각형의 내각의 합을 이용해 그림의 각을 차례로 계산한다. 그림의 대응 위치와 조건을 함께 확인하면 주어진 정답과 일치하는 결과는 ⑤이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/25_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q20.png","exists":true,"sha256":"b8edbb4fb7b353b2b65b665a56ed7dc8e08c59b77940e2584f0062b888d90e2f"}],"semanticContext":{"standardUnitKey":"M1-05","subUnitKey":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","primaryMethod":"midpoint_of_orthogonal_projections_and_signed_height","decisiveStep":"The diagram places A,M,D collinearly with M between A and D. Let AM be the x-axis with A=0 and D=18; DM=4 gives M=14. Orthogonal projection of midpoint M of BC onto AM shows M is also the midpoint of D and E, so ME=4 and AE=10. Since M lies on AM and is the midpoint of BC, B and C have opposite signed perpendicular heights, hence CE=BD=10. Therefore area(△ACE)=1/2·AE·CE=1/2·10·10=50 cm² (choice ⑤).","problemTypeKey":"M1-05-MIDPOINT_PROJECTION_TRIANGLE_AREA","templateKey":"TRIANGLE_MIDPOINT_WITH_TWO_PERPENDICULAR_PROJECTIONS_RECOVER_AREA","crossConceptKeys":["TRIANGLE_AREA"],"conditionKeys":[],"integrationPattern":"INTERDEPENDENT","reviewStatus":"PROPOSED","sourceIssue":"The archived solution is a generic angle-chasing statement and omits the decisive projection-midpoint and signed-height argument. The original-resolution diagram and printed lengths support 50 cm² independently."},"inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceFingerprint","inputBundleSha","contentHash","solutionHash","content","choices","answer","solution","images","semanticContext"],"blindInputSha":"5620a3a2b80223909f9b364de12fc6562d42737f6f07238159a3b4c6c1413023"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_71befc5c53542a307028afdb767f331a43590195f1537cc323e6dd76013291c6","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/25_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":21,"sourceFingerprint":"0f8d9fac05c904672b7892801993d0934862553fbfadc524bcf961114a02f668","inputBundleSha":"986cfab750128f80310b842785489c4e662167e6dbfe8efcee8580a6daf4a813","contentHash":"1fbfd42cc9b4624cbb4e132e2ac2c5cf1249948366ca5a4710946ed81bfb6eac","solutionHash":"5c2b5354a6826ee6a8236e3486faf1b46766261ebcd6ca1bc01f5b78b7c7d02b","content":"[서술형 1] 다음 그림과 같이 정비례 관계 $y=\\dfrac54x$의 그래프 위의 점 $A$에서 $x$축에 수선을 그었을 때, $x$축과 만나는 점 $B$의 좌표는 $(8,0)$이다. 다음 물음에 답하시오. [5점]","choices":[],"answer":"(1) $(8,10)$ (2) $40$","solution":"풀이: 주어진 식 또는 그래프에서 좌표의 부호와 변화 관계를 확인하고, 문제의 조건을 식으로 정리한다. 그림의 대응 위치와 조건을 함께 확인하면 주어진 정답과 일치하는 결과는 (1) $(8,10)$ (2) $40$이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/25_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q21.png","exists":true,"sha256":"6ad46df638bea321bb081cc5c7067bdd3c8d8bbbf89dadb2cc80344d97f9a8dd"}],"semanticContext":{"standardUnitKey":"M1-04","subUnitKey":"M1-04-COORDINATE_PLANE","primaryMethod":"direct-proportion substitution and area","decisiveStep":"A lies on y=(5/4)x with x=8, so A=(8,10). Then area △AOB=½·8·10=40.","problemTypeKey":"PT_COORD_TRIANGLE_AREA","templateKey":"GRAPH_SUBSTITUTION_THEN_RIGHT_TRIANGLE_AREA","crossConceptKeys":[],"conditionKeys":[],"integrationPattern":"SEQUENTIAL","reviewStatus":"PROPOSED","sourceIssue":null},"inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceFingerprint","inputBundleSha","contentHash","solutionHash","content","choices","answer","solution","images","semanticContext"],"blindInputSha":"03ce7c718caa06a72ee07c244a1c0fd43819a955e9f2bcd9c3dff9e1d3206197"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_dbd2626d30b8c1157df867b00f5eddc5e4f528aad38fd308424ea68bd9e31af2","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/25_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":22,"sourceFingerprint":"4db043296f03f6ed1b321d42fd9b39061f188433757001460d94b6e72caa1017","inputBundleSha":"f4f755227e4a677923e6ff5b59ceb09c816cc43f2d654fd95c8adebecf7e12ac","contentHash":"9125b4164e368c69e89c8880bf81045cd0bc980bb80cdfa3eb35f71757ce7a43","solutionHash":"455510dc66d2f34be6024af6096ca3cf62facb3ce8a4e38e9708383158ba77f9","content":"[서술형 2] 다음 그림과 같이 직선 $l$ 위에 있는 네 점 $A$, $B$, $C$, $D$와 직선 $l$ 위에 있지 않은 한 점 $P$가 있다. 이 중 두 점을 골라 만들 수 있는 직선의 개수를 $a$, 반직선의 개수를 $b$, 선분의 개수를 $c$라 할 때, $a+b+c$의 값을 구하는 과정을 자세히 서술하시오. [4점]","choices":[],"answer":"$29$","solution":"풀이: 직선각과 맞꼭지각, 평행선의 동위각·엇각 및 삼각형의 내각의 합을 이용해 그림의 각을 차례로 계산한다. 그림의 대응 위치와 조건을 함께 확인하면 주어진 정답과 일치하는 결과는 $29$이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/25_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q22.png","exists":true,"sha256":"6d6837fe60570b9ecb706db46d9559d6ad57ac57406b19bf391ee2d9140503fe"}],"semanticContext":{"standardUnitKey":"M1-05","subUnitKey":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","primaryMethod":"Count distinct geometric objects with a collinear quadruple","decisiveStep":"The six pairs among A,B,C,D name one line, and P joined to each gives four other lines, so a=5. There are C(5,2)=10 segments. Rays count as 2 from each endpoint A,D, 3 from each interior point B,C, and 4 from off-line P, so b=14. Therefore a+b+c=5+14+10=29.","problemTypeKey":"PT_COLLINEAR_POINTS_OBJECT_COUNT","templateKey":"TPL_THREE_COLLINEAR_ONE_OFFLINE_LINE_RAY_SEGMENT_COUNTS","crossConceptKeys":[],"conditionKeys":[],"integrationPattern":"SEQUENTIAL","reviewStatus":"PROPOSED","sourceIssue":"The frozen solution is unrelated angle-chasing boilerplate and does not explain the point-counting; the configuration itself is clear."},"inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceFingerprint","inputBundleSha","contentHash","solutionHash","content","choices","answer","solution","images","semanticContext"],"blindInputSha":"baaab50915707edb800792a0f660e59a68a7df1257360306aed2744c05b9853e"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_7e7daaa8de9d161000e9669ff4da4f7bf381397beaa4ad5f3b499110fb9d0125","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/25_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":23,"sourceFingerprint":"970d0fb500696fd46587f164ad7a427b67c60d93daf85163a571a1188a08f829","inputBundleSha":"423c46df8ccdf1233f8eb8eaab2567785c4c89012207383db648f412297ab390","contentHash":"c4fdcc06c9bcf3b60a1bc4410e92725d17c4ff45ad9c4abf4eb2207978574b85","solutionHash":"bb9656976b317865ccaac441cd639a7281c039246f424e621b6eae0c7b34b627","content":"[서·논술형 3] 다음 그림은 직사각형 모양의 종이를 선분 $CD$와 선분 $EF$를 접는 선으로 하여 접은 것이다. $\\angle ABC=66^\\circ$, $\\angle BDE=58^\\circ$일 때, $\\angle DEF+\\angle DFE$의 크기를 구하고, 구하는 풀이 과정을 자세히 설명하시오. [5점]","choices":[],"answer":"$124^\\circ$","solution":"풀이: 직선각과 맞꼭지각, 평행선의 동위각·엇각 및 삼각형의 내각의 합을 이용해 그림의 각을 차례로 계산한다. 그림의 대응 위치와 조건을 함께 확인하면 주어진 정답과 일치하는 결과는 $124^\\circ$이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/25_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q23.png","exists":true,"sha256":"27ed99530b96d6d4611f9414807a999ee6933eb2aa4cfee362ae36b9a695df53"}],"semanticContext":{"standardUnitKey":"M1-05","subUnitKey":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","primaryMethod":"Transfer a fold-related straight-line angle through parallel rectangle edges","decisiveStep":"In the original diagram BA and BD are opposite rays and BC∥DF. Since angle ABC=66 degrees, DB makes 114 degrees with rightward DF; angle BDE=58 degrees leaves angle EDF=56 degrees. Therefore angle DEF+angle DFE=180−56=124 degrees.","problemTypeKey":"FOLDING_PARALLEL_LINES_TRIANGLE_ANGLE_SUM","templateKey":"FOLDED_RECTANGLE_SUM_OF_TWO_TRIANGLE_ANGLES","crossConceptKeys":[],"conditionKeys":[],"integrationPattern":"SEQUENTIAL","reviewStatus":"PROPOSED","sourceIssue":"The source answer 124 degrees is verifiable from the original diagram, but the archived generic solution omits the necessary straight-ray and parallel-side transfer and remains a separate solution-quality finding."},"inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceFingerprint","inputBundleSha","contentHash","solutionHash","content","choices","answer","solution","images","semanticContext"],"blindInputSha":"125c51e437826e7b0beb703e9393f071545bdc92e6bbcc16db10539f415a56c6"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_9c648fe8e985af08e260cc06bde504a2d65e296cf1139d81723717bcf202549e","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/25_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":24,"sourceFingerprint":"998010e8b76894b617935165a73e7b84639411f01c57af82d72228c950c10817","inputBundleSha":"0068a271a9cd9772c7d074f882029e4b2ebc330f5fe4bc368ddfa27a70c21dec","contentHash":"08a3515b54b3556913811143f469c27bb630049dd5abe3fda225fc7d2eaa2453","solutionHash":"f15df2da0d805560821dd016cb9eb5f7e6a2bf535d621cec866b5035db081ad8","content":"[서·논술형 4] 다음 그림과 같이 한 변의 길이가 $8\\,\\mathrm{cm}$인 정사각형 $ABCD$의 두 대각선의 교점 $O$를 꼭짓점으로 가지고 한 변의 길이가 $6\\,\\mathrm{cm}$인 정사각형 $OEFG$, $OHIJ$를 그렸다. 다음 물음에 답하시오. [6점]","choices":[],"answer":"(1) $\\angle POC=\\angle QOD$, $\\overline{OC}=\\overline{OD}$, $\\angle PCO=\\angle QDO=45^\\circ$이므로 $\\triangle OPC\\equiv\\triangle OQD$ (ASA 합동) (2) $16\\,\\mathrm{cm}^2$ (3) $32\\,\\mathrm{cm}^2$","solution":"풀이: 그림의 모서리와 면의 관계를 정의에 따라 확인하여 만남·평행·수직·꼬인 위치를 구분한다. 그림의 대응 위치와 조건을 함께 확인하면 주어진 정답과 일치하는 결과는 (1) $\\angle POC=\\angle QOD$, $\\overline{OC}=\\overline{OD}$, $\\angle PCO=\\angle QDO=45^\\circ$이므로 $\\triangle OPC\\equiv\\triangle OQD$ (ASA 합동) (2) $16\\,\\mathrm{cm}^2$ (3) $32\\,\\mathrm{cm}^2$이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/25_연향중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q24.png","exists":true,"sha256":"74d45866dd4195789ee7958026ae753696927fc2beb7c5700f0bb41fc4c3513d"}],"semanticContext":{"standardUnitKey":"M1-05","subUnitKey":"M1-05-POSITION_RELATION","primaryMethod":"square symmetry, congruence, and area","decisiveStep":"In the central 8 cm square, OC=OD and diagonal angles are 45°. The 6 cm squares give ∠POC=∠QOD, so △OPC≡△OQD by ASA; congruent shaded pieces yield the requested areas 16 cm² and 32 cm².","problemTypeKey":"SQUARE_CONFIGURATION_CONGRUENCE_AND_AREA","templateKey":"ASA_TRIANGLE_PAIR_AND_COMPOSITE_AREA","crossConceptKeys":["TRIANGLE_AREA_TRANSFER"],"conditionKeys":[],"integrationPattern":"DEEP_COMPOSITE","reviewStatus":"PROPOSED","sourceIssue":"Frozen solution describes 3D edge/face relations, unrelated to this planar square/area task."},"inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceFingerprint","inputBundleSha","contentHash","solutionHash","content","choices","answer","solution","images","semanticContext"],"blindInputSha":"099278f015ee2bd5d808932293dc5c7f2bb19b7109106bccd923904731279359"}
